---
description: Frontend conventions
globs: frontend/**/*.{ts,html,scss,css}
alwaysApply: false
---

Frontend conventions:
- This frontend uses Angular.
- Follow the existing component, service, routing, and state-management patterns.
- Prefer Reactive Forms for forms with validation or non-trivial behavior.
- Keep business logic out of HTML templates.
- Reuse existing shared components before creating new ones.
- Preserve the existing visual design and layout unless redesign is requested.
- Keep API calls inside the existing service layer.
- Maintain existing naming and folder conventions.